   "WORKTREE_MERGE_CONFLICT": "WHAT: Merge conflict: {branch} with {default}.\nWHY: CONFLICT DETECTED during worktree sync.\nHOW: Resolution Steps:\n   1. Navigate to the worktree: 'cd $(tasks mount {task_id})'\n   2. Resolve the conflicts in the files indicated by 'git status'.\n   3. Commit the resolution:\n\n       git commit -m \"[{task_id}] Resolved merge conflict with {default} branch\"\n   4. Re-attempt the move:\n\n       ./hammer tasks move {task_id} TESTING\nCONSEQUENCE: Integration fail. OBEY RESOLUTION.",
   "WORKTREE_MISSING_AUTO_DEMOTED": "WHAT: Worktree '{branch}' missing, auto-demoted to PROGRESSING.\nWHY: Task worktree was not found.\nHOW: Run 'tasks mount {task_id}' to recreate the worktree.\nCONSEQUENCE: Promotion halted. MOUNT WORKTREE.",
   "CONFLICT_DETECTED": "WHAT: Merge conflicts detected in worktree '{branch}'.\nWHY: Code changes conflict with target branch.\nHOW:\n   1. Navigate to the worktree: 'cd $(tasks mount {task_id})'\n   2. Run: git status (to see conflicted files)\n   3. Resolve conflicts manually\n   4. Stage and commit: git add . && git commit -m 'Resolved conflicts'\n   5. Re-attempt the move.\nCONSEQUENCE: Promotion halted. RESOLVE CONFLICT.",
-  "GUARD_DUPLICATE_ID": "WHAT: Task ID {task_id} claimed by MULTIPLE branch.\nWHY: DUPLICATE ID. HAMMER cannot know which branch is the real task.\nHOW: Run 'hammer tasks doctor --fix' to reconcile — the guard never deletes branches itself. --force overrides (bypass is logged).\nCONSEQUENCE: Silent task identity corruption. REJECTED.",
+  "GUARD_DUPLICATE_ID": "WHAT: Task ID {task_id} claimed by MULTIPLE branch.\nWHY: DUPLICATE ID. HAMMER cannot know which branch is the real task.\nHOW: Run 'hammer tasks doctor --fix' to reconcile \u2014 the guard never deletes branches itself. --force overrides (bypass is logged).\nCONSEQUENCE: Silent task identity corruption. REJECTED.",
