-  "GUARD_STATE_DUPLICATE": "WHAT: Task ID {task_id} live in MULTIPLE state folder.\nWHY: SAME ID IN TWO PLACES. HAMMER guess which one is real — guess is not authority.\nHOW: Run 'hammer guard scan' for the full list, then 'hammer tasks doctor --fix' to reconcile. --force overrides (bypass is logged).\nCONSEQUENCE: Corrupted state, silent divergence. REJECTED.",
