   "GUARD_BRANCH_NONCONFORMANT": "WHAT: Branch '{branch}' BREAK CONVENTION.\nWHY: HAMMER demand <id>-<type>-<slug>.\nHOW: Run 'hammer tasks doctor --fix' to correct metadata 'Br' to the folder name. --force overrides (bypass is logged).\nCONSEQUENCE: Guard cannot verify identity. REJECTED.",
   "GUARD_BRANCH_MISSING": "WHAT: Task {task_id} has NO LOCAL BRANCH.\nWHY: {to_state} require the branch to exist and be pushed.\nHOW: Run 'hammer tasks mount {task_id}' to restore it, or move the task back to PROGRESSING.\nCONSEQUENCE: Work trapped locally. REJECTED.",
