   "STORE_WRITE_FAIL": "WHAT: Git refused to stage or commit this task's store changes.\nWHY: The shared .tasks store is one repo used by every agent; a failed write means this update exists on disk but never reaches the record, and would be silently lost.\nHOW: Check for a stale .tasks/.git/index.lock or a broken store repo, then retry the checkpoint.\nCONSEQUENCE: Task record incomplete. Do not retry blindly.",
